<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sanctuary</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 10), Paladin (guild level 30)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast sanctuary &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast sanctuary</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>The target glows in a bright white light, and aggressive monsters leave them 
alone: they don't attack on sight. Just before it ends, the light flickers, 
and when it fades, they attack on sight again.
</p><p>It ends at once if the target attacks anyone. It lasts from a minute up to 
several minutes, longer the better your protection sphere, and it doesn't 
add up on someone who already has it. You must be standing. It is also found 
on scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>